Leafia's Cursed Addon — 1.21.1 / NeoForge port
==============================================

This mod is a from-scratch port of **NTM Cursed (Addon Edition)** to Minecraft 1.21.1 /
NeoForge. The original is:

    NTM-Cursed-Addon
    https://github.com/ntmleafia/NTM-Cursed-Addon
    Copyright (c) ntmleafia and contributors

    Created by ntmleafia, with movblock, who helped kickstart it.

The original targets Minecraft 1.12.2 and NTM Community Edition, and is **dual-licensed
GPL-3.0 and LGPL-3.0**. This port is taken under the **LGPL-3.0** limb of that dual licence,
which matches the licence of the mod it extends; see LICENSE.LESSER in the repository root.

Attribution here is an obligation of that licence, not a courtesy. Where a file in this
mod is adapted from a specific upstream file, its class documentation names the upstream
path, in the same way the base mod's ported files name theirs.

This port is not affiliated with, and is not endorsed by, the authors of the original addon.

Balance note
------------

The original reads many of its constants from NTM Community Edition 1.12.2, which is a
different fork of Hbm's Nuclear Tech Mod from the 1.7.10 sources this port is built against.
Where the two disagree, this port keeps the 1.7.10 value and records the difference
(D-1000).

The Custom Control Panel (NTM-CE)
---------------------------------

The Custom Control Panel under `com.leafia.contents.machines.controlpanel.core` is adapted
from the control panel of NTM Community Edition (the 1.12.2 fork of Hbm's Nuclear Tech Mod
that the original addon extends):

    Hbm's Nuclear Tech Mod - Community Edition
    https://github.com/MisterNorwood/Hbm-s-Nuclear-Tech-CE
    Copyright (c) HbmMods and the NTM Community Edition contributors

    Source package: com.hbm.inventory.control_panel, with the panel block, block entity,
    update packet and renderer that exist only for it.

NTM Community Edition is licensed under the GPL-3.0 and the LGPL-3.0; this port is taken
under the **LGPL-3.0** limb, as the rest of the addon is. Neither the 1.7.10 original nor the NEO
Edition port has a control panel, so for this subsystem alone NTM-CE is the reference for the
core and the original addon's source for its extensions (D-3060). Each adapted class names its upstream path in its
class documentation. Leafia's own panel code (the instruments, nodes and the IC10 interpreter)
is credited above.

Assets that arrive with the rendering batches (the panel and instrument models and textures)
are listed here when they are copied. Copied so far:

    assets/hbm/textures/blocks/control_panel0.png  ->  assets/leafia/textures/block/control_panel0.png
        (the placeholder face of the panel block until its renderer lands; CE batch CCP-PANEL, D-3063)

    CCP-DRAW (D-3065), converted by script:
    assets/hbm/models/control_panel/*.obj (13)  ->  assets/leafia/models/blocks/ccp_*.obj
        (the desk's OBJ also shifted to the middle of a block as ccp_item_control_panel_custom.obj)
    assets/hbm/textures/models/control_panel/<control>.png (the 10 control textures, not the *_gui.png icons)
                                                ->  assets/leafia/textures/block/ccp/<control>.png
    assets/hbm/textures/models/misc/control_panel.png                 ->  assets/leafia/textures/block/ccp/panel.png
    assets/hbm/textures/models/control_panel/control_panel_front.png  ->  assets/leafia/textures/block/ccp/panel_front.png
        (all from NTM Community Edition; the generator also writes ccp/white.png and one model JSON per OBJ object)

    assets/hbm/textures/gui/control_panel/{gui_base,gui_placement_back,gui_placement_front,
        placement_grid,gui_resize_grid,resize_grids,gui_linker_add_element}.png
        ->  assets/leafia/textures/gui/control_panel/  (the editor's backgrounds; CCP-EDITOR, D-3066)

    assets/hbm/textures/gui/control_panel/{grid,node,gui_variable_list_front}.png
        ->  assets/leafia/textures/gui/control_panel/  (the node canvas' grid, the node sprite sheet and the
        variable list's background; CCP-NODE-EDITOR, D-3067)

    CCP-IC10 (D-3073), from Leafia's Cursed Addon (NTM-Cursed-Addon), converted by script:
    src/main/java/com/leafia/contents/machines/controlpanel/ic10/IC10.java  ->  ic10/IC10.java, ic10/IC10Examples.java
        (the instruction table and the example programs, generated from Leafia's source; the interpreter and the editor pages are adapted)
    assets/leafia/textures/gui/control_panel/{gui_ic10_editor,gui_ic10_funcs,gui_ic10_funcs_extra}.png
        ->  assets/leafia/textures/gui/control_panel/  (the IC10 editor and the instruction reference)
